{"hymn":"S303","parent":"E383","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Mi terca voluntad hoy cedor","subtitle":"Anhelos—De obediencia a Cristo","syl":{"n1":"Mi","n2":["ter","i"],"n3":["ca","t"],"n4":["vo","i"],"n5":["lun","m"],"n6":["tad","t"],"n8":"hoy","n10":["ce","i"],"n11":["dor,","t"],"n12":["Qui","i"],"n13":["sie","m"],"n14":["ra","t"],"n15":"ser","n16":["só","i"],"n18":["lo","t"],"n19":"de","n21":"Ti;","n23":"Por","n24":"fin,","n25":["Se","i"],"n26":["ñor,","t"],"n28":"a","n29":"Ti","n30":"te","n31":["rue","i"],"n32":["go:","t"],"n33":"\"Tu","n34":["vo","i"],"n35":["lun","m"],"n36":["tad,","t"],"n37":"se","n38":["ha","i"],"n40":["ga‿en","t"],"n41":"mí\".","n43":"Oh,","n44":["dul","i"],"n46":["ce","t"],"n48":["vo","i"],"n50":["lun","m"],"n51":["tad","t"],"n53":["di","i"],"n55":["vi","m"],"n56":["na,","t"],"n57":["An","i"],"n58":["he","m"],"n59":["lo‿en","t"],"n60":"Ti","n62":["per","i"],"n63":["di","m"],"n64":["do‿es","m"],"n65":["tar;","t"],"n66":"Oh,","n67":["dul","i"],"n69":["ce","t"],"n71":["vo","i"],"n73":["lun","m"],"n74":["tad","t"],"n76":["di","i"],"n78":["vi","m"],"n79":["na,","t"],"n80":["An","i"],"n81":["he","m"],"n83":["lo‿en","t"],"n84":"Ti","n86":["per","i"],"n88":["di","m"],"n89":["do‿es","m"],"n90":["tar.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Muy fatigado del pecado,","La senda‿oscura me cansó;","Mas una luz hoy me anima,","Pues hallo‿en Ti mi‿estrella‿y sol."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Tu voluntad me‿ha conquistado,","Me‿envuelve‿a mí, oh Salvador;","Disfruto paz, ya no hay discordia,","Y mi‿alma libre vuela hoy."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Señor, contigo encerrado,","Mis pies no más han de vagar;","¿Habrá‿un poder que nos aparte?","Tu voluntad es mi hogar."]}]}